518
01:20:15,659 --> 01:20:17,859
Poderemos falar e vou poder me explicar.

519
01:20:21,653 --> 01:20:22,652
Jane!

520
01:20:24,952 --> 01:20:25,749
Jane?

521
01:20:27,547 --> 01:20:28,447
Jane!

522
01:20:40,537 --> 01:20:41,434
Jane?

523
