535
01:26:37,487 --> 01:26:38,586
Eu a encontrei...

536
01:26:40,385 --> 01:26:44,182
Nova, de mulher, três velocidades e
duas bolsas. Eu a encontrei...

537
01:26:50,474 --> 01:26:51,275
Jane?

538
01:26:54,771 --> 01:26:55,769
Jane...

539
01:27:02,362 --> 01:27:03,263
Jane!

540
01:27:06,859 --> 01:27:08,056
Por que se esconde de mim?

541
01:27:15,350 --> 01:27:16,449
De mim!

542
01:31:01,830 --> 01:31:02,829
Jane?

543
01:31:07,424 --> 01:31:08,322
Jane!

544
01:31:23,009 --> 01:31:23,908
Jane!

545
01:31:42,690 --> 01:31:43,490
Jane!

546
